@tradition spoon-band
// SW2, 0.92.6 item 7(a), week 10 (FX17's shape: Monday 17:45, music in the junior common room). The spoon band: every
// 8 weeks from Day 64. Anything that makes a noise is an instrument: spoons, a pan lid, a comb, a jar of rice. Femi Rossi
// counts everyone in (keen, competitive; off Mondays). Ends 18:30, before the Wren talk at 19:00.
k: 717
title: The spoon band
when: every 8 weeks monday week 2 from day 64
at: 17:45-18:30
min: 20
where: 4 pool common-room
hold: 1
who: rossi-femi always, musician 60%, juniors 35%, everyone 10%
anim: musician play, everyone play
host: rossi-femi
from: rossi-femi
invite: host=rossi-femi odds=30% line="Spoon band tonight! Bring a spoon. Or two. Junior common room."

== mail
- The spoon band tomorrow, {time}, in the junior common room. Bring anything that makes a noise. Two spoons is a whole instrument. No skill needed.

== ask
- Spoon band later. I'm on pan lid. It's a big responsibility.   #funny
- Coming to the spoon band? Rossi counts us in. Loudly.

== here
- One, two, one, two, three, four!
- Who's got the jar of rice? We need the rice.   #funny
- Keep up, spoons!

== thanks
- Rossi counts everyone in, and the junior common room fills with spoons, pan lids, a comb and a jar of rice. It nearly sounds like a song.   #funny

== chatter
- The spoon band played three songs. I think it was three.   #funny
- I was on pan lid at the spoon band. I've never been happier.   #warm
- Rossi wants the spoon band at talent night. Somebody stop him.   #funny
